==================================================
IMPORTANT IMPLEMENTATION RULES
==================================================

1. Start with a working MVP.

2. Do not over-engineer.

3. Do not implement authentication initially unless needed.

4. Keep the LLM provider configurable.

5. Keep the embedding provider configurable.

6. Do not make XYZ coordinates manually.

7. Do not use the XYZ coordinates for RAG.

8. Do not use book summaries as a replacement for source chunks.

9. RAG must use actual chunks from the uploaded book.

10. Preserve page numbers.

11. Similar books should use embeddings.

12. Three.js should only visualize the semantic coordinates.

13. LangGraph should orchestrate the RAG flow.

14. Langfuse should trace AI operations.

15. MUI should be used for application UI.

